# bmc-ui-*.tar.gz is a GitHub RELEASE ASSET, not a tag archive: a release
# asset can be re-uploaded under the same name, and GitHub exposes no digest
# for it. Pinned on purpose -- if the asset ever changes, the build fails here
# instead of silently shipping a different UI.
#
# This is now OUR fork's release, not upstream's. Upstream v3.3.6 rendered
# "vundefined" for the build version, reported the firmware name as the
# Buildroot release, shipped 668.9 KB of fonts including 21 .woff files no
# browser that can run the bundle needs, and -- despite this .mk declaring
# BMC_UI_LICENSE_FILES = LICENSE -- shipped no LICENSE at all, which for a
# GPL-2.0 work we redistribute was a real gap. Ours carries it.
#
# Verified 2026-09-07: 463923 bytes, built by GitHub Actions from tag
# v3.3.7-hive.2, checked against the release's own SHA256SUMS. hive.2 adds
# the switch-port panel, the board serial, and the doubled-"v" fix at the
# two sites hive.1 missed -- the header and the board revision.
# Locally computed:
sha256  500331a67f8ef0ce50fa3b8f077d219f84436de74a0486864c76933f629b89ff  bmc-ui-v3.3.7-hive.2.tar.gz
